# OpenAI Light — terminal adaptation of OpenAI's light developer docs.
# Black/white/gray surfaces follow the site; red, blue, and purple draw from
# its light code samples. The remaining ANSI hues are custom semantic colors,
# chosen to stay readable on white. This is not an official OpenAI theme.

